      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Ha! What about the people that raised and threatened us with their
          clubs and swords and even execution, for mere bread and barley? What could
          you possibly argue to make them worth saving?
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 705
      isRoot: 0
